<title>USA: McKesson Corp may issue $525 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>McKesson Corp may issue $525 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $525 million three-part debt offering, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The first part is expected to consist of $175 million three-year notes, the second part, $175 million in five-year debt and the final tranche is expected to consist of $175 million in 30-year debt, sources said.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be rated A3/A, sources added.</p>
<p>(( Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
